moonlake builds on packages published on mooncakes.io. They are fetched at build
time and are not bundled here; each carries its own license:

  moonbitlang/x              Apache-2.0   filesystem, argument parsing, encoding
  moonbitlang/quickcheck     Apache-2.0   property-based testing
  superbigcup325/colenc      Apache-2.0   Parquet DELTA, BYTE_STREAM_SPLIT, RLE

The Parquet reader and writer in sources/parquet implement the Apache Parquet
format (apache/parquet-format, Apache-2.0) and are verified against the
apache/parquet-testing corpus (Apache-2.0).

The TPC-H query texts in harness/queries/ are the official benchmark texts, used
here for correctness validation against DuckDB. TPC-H is a trademark of the
Transaction Processing Performance Council.
